Wit &lt;a href="Kiringan%2C%20Boyalali%2C%20Boyalali"&gt;kiringan&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="Horsfieldia%20irya"&gt;Horsfieldia irya&lt;/a&gt;) ing &lt;a href="Sundha"&gt;Sundha&lt;/a&gt; lumrahé diarani &lt;a href="kalapa%20tiyung"&gt;kalapa tiyung&lt;/a&gt;. Ana ing &lt;a href="Jawa"&gt;Jawa&lt;/a&gt; wit ana sing ngarani &lt;a href="kalak%20pacung"&gt;kalak pacung&lt;/a&gt;, kiringan, utawa &lt;a href="klapan"&gt;klapan&lt;/a&gt;. 
