<li>Marashi, Afshin, Nationalizing Iran: culture, power, and the state, 1870-1940 (University of Washington Press, 2008). &lt;a href="International%20Standard%20Book%20Number"&gt;ISBN&lt;/a&gt;</li>
<li>Moazami, Behrooz State, Religion, and Revolution in Iran, 1796 to the Present p.&amp;nbsp;41 (Palgrave Macmillan, 2013) &lt;a href="International%20Standard%20Book%20Number"&gt;ISBN&lt;/a&gt;</li>
